{"id":"d1a6bb52f0ec48eb","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-category.md","title":"Baire Category Theorem","display":"thm-category — Baire Category Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-category","aliases":["58-thm-category"],"display":"thm-category — Baire Category Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-complete-metric]]","[[58-df-zfc-top6-dense-set]]","[[../batch13/58-df-completeness.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-category — Baire Category Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"58-df-complete-metric\">58-df-complete-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"774813589e7e7881\" href=\"?note=774813589e7e7881\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top6-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top6-dense-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8a7089e68dd01fc8\" href=\"?note=8a7089e68dd01fc8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-completeness.md\">../batch13/58-df-completeness.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,\\langle U_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\">\\(X,d,\\langle U_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\)</span> (complete metric space and open dense sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d\">\\(\\tau_d\\)</span> (topology induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (topological dense-subset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (complete metric space predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induced\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induced\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(U_n\\in\\tau_d\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau_d,U_n)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S\\!\\left(X,\\tau_d,\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}U_n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(U_n\\in\\tau_d\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau_d,U_n)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S\\!\\left(X,\\tau_d,\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}U_n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The density conclusion is stronger than mere nonemptiness and remains meaningful for the empty complete metric space.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, no nonempty complete metric space is the union of countably many nowhere dense sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-complete-metric","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complete-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top6-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"774813589e7e7881","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top6-dense-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-completeness.md","status":"resolved","id":"8a7089e68dd01fc8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-completeness.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d,\\langle U_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induced\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(U_n\\in\\tau_d\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau_d,U_n)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DenseSet}_S\\!\\left(X,\\tau_d,\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}U_n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1325,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4070","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-category.md|58-thm-category]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["05d80cd20b53d8a2","774813589e7e7881","8a7089e68dd01fc8"]}